        "#| blank:\n",
        "#|   target: blank3\n",
        "#|   prefill: false\n",
        "#|   occurrence: 1\n",
        "#|   match: token\n",
        "#| blank:\n",
        "#|   target: blank4\n",
        "#|   prefill: false\n",
        "#|   occurrence: 1\n",
        "#|   match: token\n",
        "\n",
        "ggplot(duke_forest) +\n",
        "  aes(x = blank1, y = price) +\n",
        "  geom_point() + \n",
        "  labs(\n",
        "    title = \"blank2\",\n",
        "    x = \"blank3\",\n",
        "    y = \"blank4\"\n",
        "  )\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{code-blanks-response}\n",
        "Describe the relationship in this second scatterplot. Is it linear or nonlinear? Strong, moderate, or weak? If it is linear, is it positive or negative?\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "And then the correlation.\n",
        "\n",
        "```{code-blanks}\n",
        "#| blank:\n",
